<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n115608" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ψῆγ-μα</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ατος</span>, τό, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ψήχω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>that which is rubbed</i> or
				<i>scraped off, shavings, scrapings, chips,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ψ. χρυσοῦ</span> gold-<i>dust,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				4.195
			</span></i>; so without <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χρυσοῦ,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				1.93
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				3.94
			</span></i> sq.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ψ. χρυσότευκτον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Eub.
					20
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ψ. ἀργυρᾶ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Inscr.Délos</u>
					442
				</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				<u>B</u>
				89
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii B.C.)</span>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πυρωθὲν ψ.,</span>
			of dust and ashes, <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Ag.</u>
				442
			</span></i> (lyr.); of wood, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ τῶν αἰγείρων ψ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Philostr.
					<u>Im.</u>
					1.11
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἥλων ψ.,</span>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χαλκοῦ ἄνθος</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				5.77
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μὴ διαλύεσθαι μέχρι ἐλαχίστου
				ψήγματος</span> (of gum) 
			<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				3.22
			</span></i>; of <i>motes</i> in a sunbeam, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Cael.</u>
				313a20
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				304a21
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.722a
			</span></i>, and 
				v.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τίλα</span>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				11
			</span></i>.</div>
